nce-rule\">92-df-inference-rule</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\\)</span> (formal system over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}\\)</span> (formal-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\)</span> (space of inference-rule instances, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" href=\"?note=5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" title=\"92-df-inference-rule\">92-df-inference-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqCode}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqCode}\\)</span> (finite-sequence encoder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (total-recursive function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}\\)</span> (definition-target elementarity predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land R\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists a:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\,\\exists r:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Rec}(a)\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(r)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\na(n)=1\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\varphi\\in A\\;(n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(r(u,v)=1\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists(\\theta_0,\\ldots,\\theta_{\\ell-1})\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^\\ell\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}u=\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle\\ulcorner\\theta_0\\urcorner,\\ldots,\n\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\ell-1}\\urcorner\\rangle)\\land v=\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\n(\\langle\\theta_0,\\ldots,\\theta_{\\ell-1}\\rangle,\\psi)\\in R\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land R\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists a:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\,\\exists r:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Rec}(a)\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(r)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\na(n)=1\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\varphi\\in A\\;(n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(r(u,v)=1\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists(\\theta_0,\\ldots,\\theta_{\\ell-1})\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^\\ell\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}u=\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle\\ulcorner\\theta_0\\urcorner,\\ldots,\n\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\ell-1}\\urcorner\\rangle)\\land v=\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\n(\\langle\\theta_0,\\ldots,\\theta_{\\ell-1}\\rangle,\\psi)\\in R\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : 系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>是初等的</li>\n<li>初等系统的公理成员关系和有序规则实例关系可递归判定</li>\n<li>前提必须按证明中出现的顺序编码；把序列写成无序集合会丢失重复项与次序</li>\n<li>两个判定器在全部自然数输入上定义；非法公式码或非法规则码自动落在右侧存在式之外，因而判为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是不完备性定理的适用条件</li>\n<li>Smullyan用&quot;初等系统&quot;替代&quot;递归公理化&quot;条件</li>\n<li>系统G是初等系统</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnch